# Testing

- Unit tests live in `tests/unit/` and use Vitest.
- Test schemas, services, and pure utilities; mock repositories in service tests.
- Name files `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx`.
- Prefer behavior assertions over implementation details.

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
it("rejects invalid symbols", () => {
  expect(stockSymbolSchema.safeParse("").success).toBe(false);
});
```

- Add integration tests in `tests/integration/` when touching RLS or auth flows.
